    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everyone keeps telling me it gets better or that i should find a \"new purpose,\" but what if there isn't one? it's like the version of me that actually mattered is just gone. i'm just a shell of a person taking up space. it feels so pointless to keep trying to rebuild something that was never meant to survive this.",
